  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Population Recovery of the Black Turtle of Michoacan, Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient in collaboration with local communities will survey Colola and Maruata nesting beaches throughout the nesting season to count and protect nests and nesting females. The recipient will also develop a community based nesting beach conservation program to protect leatherback nests at La Placista and Brisas beaches throughtout the nesting season.</narrative>
  </description>
